{
  "app_id": 4621810,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Experience the smooth, satisfying flow of ice cream in real time. Play in two dedicated modes: Classic : Enjoy a time management challenge as the business day goes on and you need to complete all your planned tasks. Cozy : Play at your own pace without the need to worry about the passing time, prep ice cream and buy ingredients as long as you want until you're ready to open shop again. Craft delicious ice cream from scratch using fresh ingredients, mix flavors, and create the perfect texture. Turn simple ingredients into tasty, satisfying ice cream delights. Customize the icy treats based on each customer’s request with a variety of toppings and combinations. Serve exactly what they want and keep your customers happy. Keep your shop clean while things get messy. A clean space keeps the experience sweet for everyone. Turn an empty space into your dream ice cream shop. Customize your shop’s look and style to make it your own. Buy fresh ingredients from local markets, stock your shop, and keep your business running."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
